    "pros": [
      "50-inch deck suits 1 to 3 acres with obstacles",
      "MyRIDE suspension for long sessions in the seat",
      "24.5 hp engine on the 75755, per Toro and a retailer listing",
      "Listed at $4,599 by a retailer at the time of our research"
